# MCP Gateway CRD Conventions

## API Versions (RHCL operator 0.7.1 uses v1alpha1)

```yaml
apiVersion: mcp.kuadrant.io/v1alpha1
kind: MCPGatewayExtension
```

```yaml
apiVersion: mcp.kuadrant.io/v1alpha1
kind: MCPServerRegistration
```

## Gateway listeners (dual-listener pattern — see ADR-0002)

- `mcp`: public client traffic; `MCPGatewayExtension.spec.targetRef.sectionName: mcp`
  - HTTP:8080 by default (POC); set `gateway.listeners.mcp.tls.enabled: true` for HTTPS:443 on the same listener (Option A)
- `mcps`: internal backend routes; MCPServerRegistration HTTPRoutes use `sectionName: mcps` and `*.mcp.local` hostnames

## MCPGatewayExtension must target a Gateway

```yaml
spec:
  targetRef:
    group: gateway.networking.k8s.io
    kind: Gateway
    name: {{ .Values.gateway.name }}
    namespace: {{ .Values.gateway.namespace }}
    sectionName: mcp
```

## MCPServerRegistration references an HTTPRoute

```yaml
spec:
  prefix: "k8s_"
  path: "/mcp"
  targetRef:
    group: gateway.networking.k8s.io
    kind: HTTPRoute
    name: {{ route-name }}
    namespace: {{ route-namespace }}
```

## Field naming: use `prefix` (not `toolPrefix` — renamed in RHCL 1.4)
